# Commands that 'permission apply' must not pre-approve.
# These change Pinboard (add, update, restore) or commit and push the mirror
# (sync); reads, history, suggest and doctor stay pre-approved.
pinboard sync
pinboard add
pinboard update
pinboard restore
# mcp serves bookmarks to other agents and makes their writes.
pinboard mcp
# The server is an implementation detail of 'pinboard mcp', run only by it.
pinboard-mcp
